---
import ScreenshotGallery from "../ScreenshotGallery.astro";
import VuDivider from "./VuDivider.astro";
---

<section id="dashboard" class="band band-dashboard">
  <div class="container section-head" data-reveal>
    <div class="section-eyebrow">THE DASHBOARD</div>
    <h2 class="section-h2">
      A local dashboard that answers the only question that matters:
      <span class="ink">where did it go?</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="section-lede">
      The TUI and desktop app share the same archive, model registry, pricing, and report flow. The desktop is
      a seven-screen sidebar app with dedicated pages per tool, including a Coach page that grades how you work
      with 27 rules evaluated entirely on your machine; the terminal keeps it to Overview, Deep Dive, and
      Usage. In the terminal, press <kbd>1</kbd>-<kbd>5</kbd> for time ranges, <kbd>o</kbd>/<kbd>d</kbd>/<kbd>u</kbd> to switch pages, and <kbd>e</kbd> for reports.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="container cam-block">
    <ScreenshotGallery platform="desktop" />
  </div>

  <VuDivider />

  <div class="tui-band">
    <div class="container">
      <ScreenshotGallery platform="tui" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
